{"id":"wb-6-466","name":"多福寺","retrievedAt":"2026-11-06T11:54:03+00:00","status":"ready","title":"多福寺","text":"多福寺，又名崛围寺，位于中国山西太原西北的崛围山，2006年5月，列入第六批全国重点文物保护单位。\n该寺始建于唐贞元二年（786年），明洪武年间重建。该寺大雄宝殿内存的三佛四菩萨彩绘及壁画为明代佛教艺术。明末清初学者傅山曾在此隐居。","shortened":false,"sourceUrl":"https://zh.wikipedia.org/wiki/%E5%A4%9A%E7%A6%8F%E5%AF%BA","revisionId":85381943,"revisionUrl":"https://zh.wikipedia.org/w/index.php?oldid=85381943","license":"CC BY-SA 4.0","licenseUrl":"https://creativecommons.org/licenses/by-sa/4.0/","authors":"维基百科贡献者","matchEvidence":"名称与地理坐标一致","image":{"path":"assets/wikipedia/3092f570951ade497b3c5261.jpg","title":"多福寺-2010 - panoramio.jpg","sourceUrl":"https://commons.wikimedia.org/wiki/File:%E5%A4%9A%E7%A6%8F%E5%AF%BA-2010_-_panoramio.jpg","originalUrl":"https://upload.wikimedia.org/wikipedia/commons/5/5f/%E5%A4%9A%E7%A6%8F%E5%AF%BA-2010_-_panoramio.jpg?utm_source=commons.wikimedia.org&utm_campaign=imageinfo&utm_content=original","author":"Li Meng","license":"CC BY-SA 3.0","licenseUrl":"https://creativecommons.org/licenses/by-sa/3.0","caption":"多福寺-2010","width":320,"height":240,"matchEvidence":"对应 Wikidata 条目的 P18 配图"}}